TEXT 648 464 Left 2 ;RESULTS:\n \nVery dependent on D1 diode and input bias current of\nLM339.  INN is ~5V if floating -- while INP is between\n4.8V and 5.5V (11 to 13V unregulated supply).\n \nProbably want a weak pull-down on INN. Even 10-20Mohm is\nenough.
